DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
38767::$$$message_0271_0000_0000$$$::I pause as I try to go out.[lr]::
38768::$$$message_0271_0000_0001$$$::Suddenly, I remember the promise that I made with Illya.[lr]::
38769::$$$message_0271_0000_0002$$$::The weather is good today, so I should use this opportunity to bring it up.::
38770::$$$message_0271_0001_0000$$$::Illya is lying around in the living room.[lr]::
38771::$$$message_0271_0001_0001$$$::The TV is left on, books are laid out on the table, there's cake left on the plate, and she seems to be bored out of her mind.::
38772::$$$message_0271_0002_0000$$$::"It's rare to see you lazing about.[lr]::
38773::$$$message_0271_0002_0001$$$::Don't you have anything else to do today?"[lr]::
38774::$$$message_0271_0002_0002$$$::"Hmm, no.[lr]::
38775::$$$message_0271_0002_0003$$$::What a waste; I don't have to sleep until night today, yet I just happen to be bored on a day like this."[lr]::
38776::$$$message_0271_0002_0004$$$::She kicks her feet as she lies there.::
38777::$$$message_0271_0003_0000$$$::"I-Illya, hold on.[lr]::
38778::$$$message_0271_0003_0001$$$::Uh, if you move your legs in that position[line len=2]"[lr]::
38779::$$$message_0271_0003_0002$$$::"Huh? Did you say something, Shirou?"[lr]::
38780::$$$message_0271_0003_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
38781::$$$message_0271_0003_0004$$$::She's really letting her guard down.[lr]::
38782::$$$message_0271_0003_0005$$$::Illya is rowdy but has good manners. Even then, she must truly be bored to let it come to this.::
38783::$$$message_0271_0004_0000$$$::"...Well, that means it's good timing.[lr]::
38784::$$$message_0271_0004_0001$$$::All right, Illya. Let's go to the pool if you're that bored."[lr]::
38785::$$$message_0271_0004_0002$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
38786::$$$message_0271_0004_0003$$$::Illya's legs freeze.[lr]::
38787::$$$message_0271_0004_0004$$$::"Shirou, what did you just say...?"[lr]::
38788::$$$message_0271_0004_0005$$$::"Well, it's hot for autumn today, and we made a promise with Saber the other day.[lr]::
38789::$$$message_0271_0004_0006$$$::We should go to the pool together."::
38790::$$$message_0271_0005_0000$$$::"Y-you mean, with me...?"[lr]::
38791::$$$message_0271_0005_0001$$$::"With you. There's only you and me in the living room right now."[lr]::
38792::$$$message_0271_0005_0002$$$::"...[se storage=se541.wav]...!"[lr]::
38793::$$$message_0271_0005_0003$$$::The relaxed atmosphere of the living room turns rose-colored at once.::
38794::$$$message_0271_0006_0000$$$::"I'll go, I'm totally going!!![wm canskip=0][lr]::
38795::$$$message_0271_0006_0001$$$::Yay![wvl canskip=0 time=600] A pool date with Shirou[cacheimage storage=イリヤ03b(中),67ライダー過去回想_花畑][wvl][stoplquake layer=all][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ03b(中)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=2000 accel=0 storage=67ライダー過去回想_花畑][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(150,28,255)(150,0,255)(150,15,255)(150,0,255) storage=イリヤ03b(中) accel=0]!!!"::
38796::$$$message_0271_0007_0000$$$::"I-I'm glad that it makes you that happy.[lr]::
38797::$$$message_0271_0007_0001$$$::It's just the pool. Is that really okay?"[lr]::
38798::$$$message_0271_0007_0002$$$::"Of course! It's that big amusement park, right?[lr]::
38799::$$$message_0271_0007_0003$$$::I have my swimsuit ready, so I'm ready to go right away."[lr]::
38800::$$$message_0271_0007_0004$$$::"Oh. Then let's go this morning. I can get ready right away too."[lr]::
38801::$$$message_0271_0007_0005$$$::"Yep, yep! Intruders will come if we take our time, so a blitzkrieg is the way to go!"::
38802::$$$message_0271_0008_0000$$$::"No, you cannot go. A date with Master Emiya? You can only play around so much."[lr]::
38803::$$$message_0271_0008_0001$$$::"S-Sella!? Didn't you go back to the castle!?"::
38804::$$$message_0271_0009_0000$$$::"No. I stayed since your fortune this morning was horrible. Especially fortunes for relationships with the opposite sex.[lr]::
38805::$$$message_0271_0009_0001$$$::That is why I was hiding out in a vacant room so that Master Emiya would not be rude to my lady."[lr]::
38806::$$$message_0271_0009_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
38807::$$$message_0271_0009_0003$$$::...It's fine.[lr]::
38808::$$$message_0271_0009_0004$$$::But [font italic=true]isn't[font italic=false] it rude to be hiding out in someone else's place?::
38809::$$$message_0271_0010_0000$$$::"It was not a vacant room.[lr]::
38810::$$$message_0271_0010_0001$$$::Sella repurposed a room nobody's using."[lr]::
38811::$$$message_0271_0010_0002$$$::"Hmph. It is vexing, but this is like the mistress' villa. I just requisitioned a room just in case."[lr]::
38812::$$$message_0271_0010_0003$$$::Hahahaha.[lr]::
38813::$$$message_0271_0010_0004$$$::Beyond rude. This is tyranny. ::
38814::$$$message_0271_0011_0000$$$::"...So in other words, you were eavesdropping.[lr]::
38815::$$$message_0271_0011_0001$$$::Not something particularly praiseworthy, Sella."[lr]::
38816::$$$message_0271_0011_0002$$$::Illya glares at her servant.[lr]::
38817::$$$message_0271_0011_0003$$$::I nod in agreement with Illya.::
38818::$$$message_0271_0012_0000$$$::"Your scolding is reasonable. However, please understand that it is out of concern for you.[lr]::
38819::$$$message_0271_0012_0001$$$::...B-besides, I would like to repeat that I believe that it is too early for you to be going on dates.[lr]::
38820::$$$message_0271_0012_0002$$$::In addition, I cannot have you[line len=2]"[lr]::
38821::$$$message_0271_0012_0003$$$::"I cannot have you, what?"::
38822::$$$message_0271_0013_0000$$$::"I-I cannot have you taking an interest in leisure activities as sleazy as going to the pool![lr]::
38823::$$$message_0271_0013_0001$$$::Lowly beings like us aside, you are one that carries noble blood. For lowlife riffraff to be able to see any amount of your bare skin would be a travesty![lr]::
38824::$$$message_0271_0013_0002$$$::First of all, the only gentleman allowed to worship your bare skin is the person that you exchange vows with!"::
38825::$$$message_0271_0014_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38826::$$$message_0271_0014_0001$$$::...Illya's astonishment is understandable.[lr]::
38827::$$$message_0271_0014_0002$$$::I thought Sella was pretty conservative, but I didn't think she was so hardcore.::
38828::$$$message_0271_0015_0000$$$::"...All right, putting Sella's Illya argument aside.[lr]::
38829::$$$message_0271_0015_0001$$$::You say that the pool is shameful... So you don't go to the pool?"[lr]::
38830::$$$message_0271_0015_0002$$$::I feel like I've seen someone that looks like Sella at a pool before.::
38831::$$$message_0271_0016_0000$$$::"Huh? W-well, it is very hard to say whether I like it or hate it..."[lr]::
38832::$$$message_0271_0016_0001$$$::"It's Sella's third swimsuit since we came. Impressive."[lr]::
38833::$$$message_0271_0016_0002$$$::"L-L-L-Leysritt...![lr]::
38834::$$$message_0271_0016_0003$$$::...Hmph. The pool itself is innocent.[lr]::
38835::$$$message_0271_0016_0004$$$::What I consider problematic are the people that swarm around the pool[line len=2]"[lr]::
38836::$$$message_0271_0016_0005$$$::"Oh. Then we can reserve it."::
38837::$$$message_0271_0017_0000$$$::"Wh[line len=2]"[lr]::
38838::$$$message_0271_0017_0001$$$::"[line len=2]at?"[lr]::
38839::$$$message_0271_0017_0002$$$::I unconsciously meet eyes with Sella.::
38840::$$$message_0271_0018_0000$$$::"Illya, by reserve... You mean reserving Waku Waku Zabuun?"[lr]::
38841::$$$message_0271_0018_0001$$$::"Huh? Yes, it's not that strange, right?[lr]::
38842::$$$message_0271_0018_0002$$$::You know, when you go to the department store, you would reserve it for the entire day."[lr]::
38843::$$$message_0271_0018_0003$$$::She stares at me like I'm the weird one.[lr]::
38844::$$$message_0271_0018_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
38845::$$$message_0271_0018_0005$$$::...What's strange is why a princess like this is killing time at the Emiya house.::
38846::$$$message_0271_0019_0000$$$::"Sella, arrange it right away. I won't question the method. It hasn't opened yet, and you should be able to solve it just with money without using magecraft."[lr]::
38847::$$$message_0271_0019_0001$$$::"Oh... Um, Mistress, that is[line len=2]"::
38848::$$$message_0271_0020_0000$$$::"You're not going to say 'impossible' now, are you?[lr]::
38849::$$$message_0271_0020_0001$$$::I am Einzbern's successor, and you are the head maid. Are you going to deny something that I decided is possible?"::
38850::$$$message_0271_0021_0000$$$::"I-I can at least reserve a facility that size; I shall manage somehow... Right away![lr]::
38851::$$$message_0271_0021_0001$$$::However, having Master Emiya accompany you is[line len=2]"[lr]::
38852::$$$message_0271_0021_0002$$$::"That's no problem either. Shirou is my future partner. Accompanying me to the pool is natural, right?"::
38853::$$$message_0271_0022_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"[lr]::
38854::$$$message_0271_0022_0001$$$::"[line len=2]aaat!?"[lr]::
38855::$$$message_0271_0022_0002$$$::Instinctively...[wait canskip=0 time=300][textoff][clfg][fg opacity=0 left=133 index=4000 top=124 storage=035_赤a][fg opacity=0 left=86 index=5000 top=137 storage=035_赤b][fg index=3000 pos=c storage=イリヤ02b(中)][fg index=2000 pos=l storage=セラ02a(中)][fg index=1000 pos=r storage=リズ01a(中)][move page=back spread=1 mx=191 magnify=6 time=1200 my=151 path=(191,151,255,1) storage=035_赤a accel=2][move page=back spread=1 mx=146 magnify=6 time=1200 my=165 path=(146,165,255,1) storage=035_赤b accel=2][se volume=80 time=400 storage=se655.wav][fadein time=300 storage=i衛宮邸居間(fd) noclear=1][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=800][sestop storage=se655.wav time=1000 nowait=1]I couldn't make eye contact with Sella.[lr]::
38856::$$$message_0271_0022_0003$$$::I'm scared. I'm super scared.[lr]::
38857::$$$message_0271_0022_0004$$$::Also, things have gotten rather rowdy in here.::
38858::$$$message_0271_0023_0000$$$::"...Understood.[lr]::
38859::$$$message_0271_0023_0001$$$::Then, you are saying that you will go to the pool with Master Emiya no matter what, correct?"[lr]::
38860::$$$message_0271_0023_0002$$$::"Yes. I won't listen even if you try to stop me."::
38861::$$$message_0271_0024_0000$$$::Illya's resolution is firm.[lr]::
38862::$$$message_0271_0024_0001$$$::After Sella glances at Illya worriedly and gives me the stink eye...::
38863::$$$message_0271_0025_0000$$$::"...Understood. If you are willing to go that far, then I will not stop you. I shall surely, absolutely reserve Waku Waku Zabuun.[lr]::
38864::$$$message_0271_0025_0001$$$::However, I also have one condition."[lr]::
38865::$$$message_0271_0025_0002$$$::"Condition?"[lr]::
38866::$$$message_0271_0025_0003$$$::"Yes. If you are saying that you will go to the pool with Master Emiya no matter what..."::
38867::$$$message_0271_0026_0000$$$::The wicked maid smirks.[lr]::
38868::$$$message_0271_0026_0001$$$::She briefly and concisely states her terms.::
38869::$$$message_0271_0027_0000$$$::"Huh? Just that?"[lr]::
38870::$$$message_0271_0027_0001$$$::"Yes, it is something along those lines."[lr]::
38871::$$$message_0271_0027_0002$$$::An anticlimactic answer.[lr]::
38872::$$$message_0271_0027_0003$$$::Sella's terms were simple, and Illya accepted Sella's request.[lr]::
38873::$$$message_0271_0027_0004$$$::...Correction.[lr]::
38874::$$$message_0271_0027_0005$$$::She unfortunately accepted it.::
38875::$$$message_0271_0028_0000$$$::"Mm, it's the perfect day for the pool![lr]::
38876::$$$message_0271_0028_0001$$$::It's as expected of Einzbern to be able to reserve Zabuun on a day like this. I wouldn't ever want to waste money like that even if I was going to die, but it feels good when someone else does it! [humming]"::
38877::$$$message_0271_0029_0000$$$::"Indeed. And on top of that, you invited us even though we were not part of the plan originally.[lr]::
38878::$$$message_0271_0029_0001$$$::I appreciate this, Illyasviel. It seems as though I had misunderstood you.[lr]::
38879::$$$message_0271_0029_0002$$$::And Shirou, I also misunderstood you too."::
38880::$$$message_0271_0030_0000$$$::"Woah, it really says, 'Closed for Today'... Wow. This is something that people might only get to experience once in their lives.[lr]::
38881::$$$message_0271_0030_0001$$$::Actually, this probably wouldn't even happen once![lr]::
38882::$$$message_0271_0030_0002$$$::Thank you very much, Illya! I-I will be staying quiet on the side!"::
38883::$$$message_0271_0031_0000$$$::"Sakura, there is no need to be modest.[lr]::
38884::$$$message_0271_0031_0001$$$::Everyone is equal at the poolside. That is a place where one competes with just their physique... I'm sure you would be able to take over the spotlight."::
38885::$$$message_0271_0032_0000$$$::"Wow, you're rather confident, Rider.[lr]::
38886::$$$message_0271_0032_0001$$$::But, the poolside goddess should be a perfectionist. Even if one part is grown, it won't mean anything if the other parts are inferior.[lr]::
38887::$$$message_0271_0032_0002$$$::Didn't you gain a bit of weight, Sakura?"::
38888::$$$message_0271_0033_0000$$$::"...Is it the golden rule? ...I guess there is a concerning factor in that regard..."[lr]::
38889::$$$message_0271_0033_0001$$$::"...Oof... Then, Rider is number one..."[lr]::
38890::$$$message_0271_0033_0002$$$::"What is it, Rider? Is there something on my shoulder?"[lr]::
38891::$$$message_0271_0033_0003$$$::"No... And it is true that everyone has their own preferences.[lr]::
38892::$$$message_0271_0033_0004$$$::Some prefer volume, some look for balance, and some even think that less is more.[lr]::
38893::$$$message_0271_0033_0005$$$::If the judge's tastes are biased, then the strongest enemy is Saber, or..."::
38894::$$$message_0271_0034_0000$$$::"It's the balance. It's meaningless if the parameter isn't perfectly balanced. Do you know Liebig's barrel?"[lr]::
38895::$$$message_0271_0034_0001$$$::"I-isn't it like how Japanese people like indulging in one luxurious item? You know, like that principle from that one show, something-Yamato?"::
38896::$$$message_0271_0035_0000$$$::"...I cannot comprehend what you two are talking about, but... What about you, Rider?"[lr]::
38897::$$$message_0271_0035_0001$$$::"...I'm out of the question. Even if I do have a marginally good physique, I am nowhere close to others here.[lr]::
38898::$$$message_0271_0035_0002$$$::...Saber, you must appreciate how wonderful your body is more."::
38899::$$$message_0271_0036_0000$$$::The group strides through the park in front of the station in a lively manner.[lr]::
38900::$$$message_0271_0036_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
38901::$$$message_0271_0036_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
38902::$$$message_0271_0036_0003$$$::...This is difficult to say, but...[lr]::
38903::$$$message_0271_0036_0004$$$::I am in the same party as that group.::
38904::$$$message_0271_0037_0000$$$::"...Sorry, Shirou."[lr]::
38905::$$$message_0271_0037_0001$$$::"...No. I'm also sorry, Illya."[lr]::
38906::$$$message_0271_0037_0002$$$::It's not that I didn't realize Sella was eavesdropping.[lr]::
38907::$$$message_0271_0037_0003$$$::It's that I accidentally talked about the pool at the Emiya house without thinking.::
38908::$$$message_0271_0038_0000$$$::"Oh, what happened, Master Emiya? You seem to be down.[lr]::
38909::$$$message_0271_0038_0001$$$::Heheh. You cannot escort the mistress amidst this chaos."[lr]::
38910::$$$message_0271_0038_0002$$$::"Yeah. Shirou, feel better."[lr]::
38911::$$$message_0271_0038_0003$$$::Leys pats my shoulder.::
38912::$$$message_0271_0039_0000$$$::The story goes back to an hour ago.[lr]::
38913::$$$message_0271_0039_0001$$$::The terms for agreeing that Sella brought up were to bring the other tenants.::
38914::$$$message_0271_0040_0000$$$::"Oh, that's it?"[lr]::
38915::$$$message_0271_0040_0001$$$::"Hmm... If there's no other way, I'm fine if it's just Saber."[lr]::
38916::$$$message_0271_0040_0002$$$::"...So that is fine?[lr]::
38917::$$$message_0271_0040_0003$$$::Ahem. Then, let us take a vote. Those who would like to go to Waku Waku Zabuun, please come in."::
38918::$$$message_0271_0041_0000$$$::"Me! I'll cancel all my afternoon plans and come along."[lr]::
38919::$$$message_0271_0041_0001$$$::"T-[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Tohsaka!? Where did you come from!?"[lr]::
38920::$$$message_0271_0041_0002$$$::"Umm... T-the more the merrier!"[lr]::
38921::$$$message_0271_0041_0003$$$::"Sakura!? Y-you were eavesdropping too!?"::
38922::$$$message_0271_0042_0000$$$::"Eavesdropping sounds disreputable. We just merely happened to be cleaning the hallway on a whim.[lr]::
38923::$$$message_0271_0042_0001$$$::Rin was sweeping the outdoor corridor.[lr]::
38924::$$$message_0271_0042_0002$$$::And over there..."[lr]::
38925::$$$message_0271_0042_0003$$$::"I-I remembered that I had sweets that I had saved, so I just had to go to the kitchen."::
38926::$$$message_0271_0043_0000$$$::...I was too naïve.[lr]::
38927::$$$message_0271_0043_0001$$$::A few minutes pass from Illya's shouts of joy.[lr]::
38928::$$$message_0271_0043_0002$$$::Before we knew it, the living room was completely full.::
38929::$$$message_0271_0044_0000$$$::"What happened, you two? It's almost time to go. It won't be good if you get tired before even setting foot in the place."[lr]::
38930::$$$message_0271_0044_0001$$$::"Whose fault do you think that is?"[lr]::
38931::$$$message_0271_0044_0002$$$::I roll my eyes and protest.[lr]::
38932::$$$message_0271_0044_0003$$$::It's a good thing to be lively, but I wanted it to be a bit more quiet for today.::
38933::$$$message_0271_0045_0000$$$::"I wanna go, I wanna go, I wanna gooo!!![lr]::
38934::$$$message_0271_0045_0001$$$::Yay! It's a pool date with Shirouuu!"[lr]::
38935::$$$message_0271_0045_0002$$$::I feel sorry when I think back at how happy Illya was.::
38936::$$$message_0271_0046_0000$$$::"You look obviously unhappy. You're so unsubtle when it comes to these kinds of things as usual."[lr]::
38937::$$$message_0271_0046_0001$$$::"What do you mean, 'these kinds of things'?"[lr]::
38938::$$$message_0271_0046_0002$$$::"How you're not too picky about many things, yet you don't hide the things that you don't like.[lr]::
38939::$$$message_0271_0046_0003$$$::Would you have preferred to go with just Illya?"[lr]::
38940::$$$message_0271_0046_0004$$$::"Of course. That was the plan from the start."::
38941::$$$message_0271_0047_0000$$$::"Then why don't you find a place where you can be alone, just the two of you?[lr]::
38942::$$$message_0271_0047_0001$$$::We'll find the right timing and split up. I'll bring Sella, Leys and Saber with everyone else over here."[lr]::
38943::$$$message_0271_0047_0002$$$::Tohsaka whispers in my ear.[lr]::
38944::$$$message_0271_0047_0003$$$::...I don't know if Tohsaka feels bad for Illya too, but she's being so kind that it's scary.::
38945::$$$message_0271_0048_0000$$$::"...I appreciate it, but you're not scheming anything, are you?"[lr]::
38946::$$$message_0271_0048_0001$$$::"Oh, how uncouth. Of course I won't peek or eavesdrop. Please enjoy your time with Illya."::
38947::$$$message_0271_0049_0000$$$::"...That's even more suspicious. Well, are you sure it's okay to leave a teenage girl and boy alone together?"[lr]::
38948::$$$message_0271_0049_0001$$$::"I trust you in that regard.[lr]::
38949::$$$message_0271_0049_0002$$$::Even if we're not keeping watch, you'd never consider something unwholesome, right?"[lr]::
38950::$$$message_0271_0049_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
38951::$$$message_0271_0049_0004$$$::...Could this be her giving me a warning?::
38952::$$$message_0271_0050_0000$$$::"Well, let's have fun with everyone for a while. The day is long after all!"[lr]::
38953::$$$message_0271_0050_0001$$$::She turns away and parts with Saber and the others.[lr]::
38954::$$$message_0271_0050_0002$$$::She's got the turning performance of a piston engine.::
38955::$$$message_0271_0051_0000$$$::"...What do we do with Rin? It's rare for someone to be such an obvious people pleaser."[lr]::
38956::$$$message_0271_0051_0001$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
38957::$$$message_0271_0051_0002$$$::"I'm saying she's the same as you. Rin is being considerate in her own way.[lr]::
38958::$$$message_0271_0051_0003$$$::Well, the fact that she has a rule that she herself has to have fun is what makes you two different."::
38959::$$$message_0271_0052_0000$$$::Illya's voice is bright, contrary to her attitude.[lr]::
38960::$$$message_0271_0052_0001$$$::Her being down up until now is almost like a lie.::
38961::$$$message_0271_0053_0000$$$::"Illya, are you fine with this? Even though this isn't like what we were planning."[lr]::
38962::$$$message_0271_0053_0001$$$::"Nothing can be done at this point.[lr]::
38963::$$$message_0271_0053_0002$$$::I was thinking that I should look on the bright side of things. It's not often that you invite me, there's a perfect pool, and that everyone is together like this, right?"::
38964::$$$message_0271_0054_0000$$$::...Hm.[lr]::
38965::$$$message_0271_0054_0001$$$::Come to think of it, this is as rare of an event as going to the pool with just me and Illya.::
38966::$$$message_0271_0055_0000$$$::"Yeah, you're right. This is like a once-in-a-year sort of occurrence."[lr]::
38967::$$$message_0271_0055_0001$$$::"Right? It'll be a waste if we don't enjoy it.[lr]::
38968::$$$message_0271_0055_0002$$$::We should also enjoy ourselves.[lr]::
38969::$$$message_0271_0055_0003$$$::It's different from what I was expecting, but it doesn't change the fact that it'll be fun."::
38970::$$$message_0271_0056_0000$$$::She smiles.[lr]::
38971::$$$message_0271_0056_0001$$$::There's a few more minutes until we reach our destination. Illya hurries to Zabuun, with energy that at least matches the others' excitement.::
38972::$$$message_0271_0057_0000$$$::"There really isn't anyone here..."[lr]::
38973::$$$message_0271_0057_0001$$$::The lockers are lined up like tri-fold mirrors,[lr]::
38974::$$$message_0271_0057_0002$$$::and there are changing room partitions lined up against the wall.[lr]::
38975::$$$message_0271_0057_0003$$$::The usually busy locker room only has me in it.[lr]::
38976::$$$message_0271_0057_0004$$$::We reserved it, so that's not a surprise, but it is still a little strange to be in such a large place all by my lonesome.::
38977::$$$message_0271_0058_0000$$$::"All right, I'm ready. I guess I'm supposed to head over to the poolside first."[lr]::
38978::$$$message_0271_0058_0001$$$::I close my locker and head to the poolside.[lr]::
38979::$$$message_0271_0058_0002$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
38980::$$$message_0271_0058_0003$$$::On the way, it bothers me that there's just one locker with a lock on it.::
38981::$$$message_0271_0059_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38982::$$$message_0271_0059_0001$$$::I hold back the temptation to raise my voice and take off to the poolside.[lr]::
38983::$$$message_0271_0059_0002$$$::The beaming summer sunrays.[lr]::
38984::$$$message_0271_0059_0003$$$::Artificial waves as far as the eye can see.[lr]::
38985::$$$message_0271_0059_0004$$$::Wow.[lr]::
38986::$$$message_0271_0059_0005$$$::I want to shout something.[lr]::
38987::$$$message_0271_0059_0006$$$::I thought that I would get lonely if we reserved such a huge space, but that was a needless worry.::
38988::$$$message_0271_0060_0000$$$::"I wanna go in... I wanna swim... I wanna go underwater."[lr]::
38989::$$$message_0271_0060_0001$$$::My body is itching to go in.[lr]::
38990::$$$message_0271_0060_0002$$$::When there's no one in such a big pool, it makes me want to shout out and rush in.::
38991::$$$message_0271_0061_0000$$$::"...No, I need to hold back. I'm here with everyone, so why am I trying to get a head start in having fun?"[lr]::
38992::$$$message_0271_0061_0001$$$::I need to hold out like a man.[lr]::
38993::$$$message_0271_0061_0002$$$::I don't think I can endure it if I touch the water, so I wait for Saber and the others a bit away from the poolside.::
38994::$$$message_0271_0062_0000$$$::"Thank you for waiting. You were the first to arrive after all, Shirou."[lr]::
38995::$$$message_0271_0062_0001$$$::"Oh, Saber."[lr]::
38996::$$$message_0271_0062_0002$$$::I look back in response to the voice behind me.[lr]::
38997::$$$message_0271_0062_0003$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
38998::$$$message_0271_0062_0004$$$::...But I have to confess...[lr]::
38999::$$$message_0271_0062_0005$$$::I completely didn't understand how big of a deal it would be to go to the pool with everyone until this moment.::
39000::$$$message_0271_0063_0000$$$::"H-how do I look, Shirou?[lr]::
39001::$$$message_0271_0063_0001$$$::It's my first time wearing a swimsuit, so I am not confident that this is for me."[lr]::
39002::$$$message_0271_0063_0002$$$::She looks at me with half-worry and half-anticipation.[lr]::
39003::$$$message_0271_0063_0003$$$::"...Well. If you ask me, I think you look outstanding."::
39004::$$$message_0271_0064_0000$$$::My mind stops working. It was cracked open by the surprise.[lr]::
39005::$$$message_0271_0064_0001$$$::The white swimsuit, which seems like something Saber would wear, has a bold design, in contrast to that purity.[lr]::
39006::$$$message_0271_0064_0002$$$::The bikini-type swimsuit shows off Saber's beautiful skin.::
39007::$$$message_0271_0065_0000$$$::"Thank you. Your swimsuit looks good on you too."[lr]::
39008::$$$message_0271_0065_0001$$$::"Uh... [shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Oh, good, thanks![lr]::
39009::$$$message_0271_0065_0002$$$::S-[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]s-so, what about Tohsaka and the others!?"[lr]::
39010::$$$message_0271_0065_0003$$$::"Rin and the others should be coming soon.[lr]::
39011::$$$message_0271_0065_0004$$$::We were doing our own things once we got inside the locker room. We were saying that the order that we get to the poolside would be on a first-come-first-served basis."::
39012::$$$message_0271_0066_0000$$$::"Yes. It is easier for us when it comes to changing. It shall probably take Sakura and Rin a while longer."[lr]::
39013::$$$message_0271_0066_0001$$$::"...Huh?"::
39014::$$$message_0271_0067_0000$$$::I get chills up my spine from the second voice.[lr]::
39015::$$$message_0271_0067_0001$$$::The cold voice that reminds me of ice is...::
39016::$$$message_0271_0068_0000$$$::The complete opposite of Saber's alluring figure.[lr]::
39017::$$$message_0271_0068_0001$$$::In contrast to what one might expect, Rider's simple black swimsuit is actually fairly conservative.[lr]::
39018::$$$message_0271_0068_0002$$$::Even if it's the same bikini type as Saber's, it has a mature chicness.[lr]::
39019::$$$message_0271_0068_0003$$$::Yet the reason that she's still alluring must be because of her voluptuous figure that can't be hidden even with a more covered-up swimsuit.::
39020::$$$message_0271_0069_0000$$$::Both of us stand upright, seeing Rider.[lr]::
39021::$$$message_0271_0069_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
39022::$$$message_0271_0069_0002$$$::I don't know what kind of emotions Saber has, but, as a guy, there's no excuse for the way that I can't take my eyes off of her.::
39023::$$$message_0271_0070_0000$$$::"T-this is..."[lr]::
39024::$$$message_0271_0070_0001$$$::I swallow the words that are about to slip out.[lr]::
39025::$$$message_0271_0070_0002$$$::In other words, another outstanding sight has appeared following Saber...!::
39026::$$$message_0271_0071_0000$$$::"Hm...? Did I come at a bad time?[lr]::
39027::$$$message_0271_0071_0001$$$::Based on how things look, perhaps I'm interrupting an important conversation...?"[lr]::
39028::$$$message_0271_0071_0002$$$::Rider worries about something completely wrong.::
39029::$$$message_0271_0072_0000$$$::"No, you did not but...[lr]::
39030::$$$message_0271_0072_0001$$$::Well. It is true that you surprised me.[lr]::
39031::$$$message_0271_0072_0002$$$::I shall honestly admit my defeat, Rider... If only I had at least half of your excess height."::
39032::$$$message_0271_0073_0000$$$::"...Saber.[lr]::
39033::$$$message_0271_0073_0001$$$::I don't want to say it aloud, but I am the one stricken with a sense of defeat.[lr]::
39034::$$$message_0271_0073_0002$$$::You do not understand your own greatness. If only I had at least a tenth of your[line len=2]"::
39035::$$$message_0271_0074_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
39036::$$$message_0271_0074_0001$$$::Rider speaks ambiguously.[lr]::
39037::$$$message_0271_0074_0002$$$::Saber and I observe Rider, who is cowering more than ever.::
39038::$$$message_0271_0075_0000$$$::"...No clue why you'd feel defeated.[lr]::
39039::$$$message_0271_0075_0001$$$::You look super cool in your swimsuit, Rider. When you're standing next to Saber, it's a feast for the eyes from different times and places."[lr]::
39040::$$$message_0271_0075_0002$$$::How lame.[lr]::
39041::$$$message_0271_0075_0003$$$::Even my compliments are food-themed!::
39042::$$$message_0271_0076_0000$$$::"I-I am aware that your intention is good, but I cannot accept that expression. [l][say storage=ctyex05_rad_0081 name=ライダー]There are no women that would be happy being called 'cool.'"[lr]::
39043::$$$message_0271_0076_0001$$$::"Really?[lr]::
39044::$$$message_0271_0076_0002$$$::I think that if it's about swimsuits, I'd say it's the best compliment."::
39045::$$$message_0271_0077_0000$$$::...A third voice joins.[lr]::
39046::$$$message_0271_0077_0001$$$::I'm used to it now. I received nuclear attacks from Rider and Saber, so I'm ready to take this on, vowing not to disgrace myself.[lr]::
39047::$$$message_0271_0077_0002$$$::There...[lr]::
39048::$$$message_0271_0077_0003$$$::...is a bright red swimsuit.::
39049::$$$message_0271_0078_0000$$$::"What do you think? Swimsuits are like combat uniforms for girls.[lr]::
39050::$$$message_0271_0078_0001$$$::Don't you think the concept of cool over cute is more fitting?"[lr]::
39051::$$$message_0271_0078_0002$$$::Tohsaka is full of confidence, so much so that I just nod along without even taking in her words.[lr]::
39052::$$$message_0271_0078_0003$$$::White, black, and now a flashy red swimsuit.[lr]::
39053::$$$message_0271_0078_0004$$$::It's a design that even makes me embarrassed, but she herself is wearing it confidently, so I don't feel bad for staring. ::
39054::$$$message_0271_0079_0000$$$::"So, what are your thoughts, Emiya?"[lr]::
39055::$$$message_0271_0079_0001$$$::"...It's so like you, I don't know what to say."[lr]::
39056::$$$message_0271_0079_0002$$$::Also, she does look cool, but I don't mention how it's equally adorable because of how frustrating it is.::
39057::$$$message_0271_0080_0000$$$::"Combat uniform... I see, it's possible to fight even in a swimsuit if it is a mage that does not do close combat... Does it mean that it would be overwhelmingly advantageous in an underwater battle?"[lr]::
39058::$$$message_0271_0080_0001$$$::"It does feel good to look at... It is very much your style."[lr]::
39059::$$$message_0271_0080_0002$$$::Rider drops her head in amazement.::
39060::$$$message_0271_0081_0000$$$::"Thank you. But it's thanks to my current company that I can feel comfortable enough to do this."[lr]::
39061::$$$message_0271_0081_0001$$$::"Hm? What do you mean by that?"::
39062::$$$message_0271_0082_0000$$$::"Everyone's wearing a different type of swimsuit, so it isn't the time to be embarrassed. Like I'll get buried if I don't make the most of what I have.[lr]::
39063::$$$message_0271_0082_0001$$$::Rider probably has the best proportions, here."::
39064::$$$message_0271_0083_0000$$$::Saber nods to Ms. Tohsaka's lecture, but Rider doesn't seem convinced.::
39065::$$$message_0271_0084_0000$$$::"Is that your own theory?[lr]::
39066::$$$message_0271_0084_0001$$$::...How shameless. Her self-assertion is very much like her."::
39067::$$$message_0271_0085_0000$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
39068::$$$message_0271_0085_0001$$$::Everyone looks back at the unexpected voice.[lr]::
39069::$$$message_0271_0085_0002$$$::The fourth voice quietly appears without any presence.[lr]::
39070::$$$message_0271_0085_0003$$$::That is unmistakably...[lr]::
39071::$$$message_0271_0085_0004$$$::Without a doubt... [wait canskip=0 time=800][wdash canskip=0][wm canskip=0][dash textoff=0 mx=0 hidefg=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=1.4 time=200 cy=5 mag=1.4 my=164 storage=o新都_室内プール-(昼) rot=-0.0 accel=2][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-102 top=226 time=200 accel=2 storage=セイバーfd特殊01g(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=147 top=342 time=200 accel=2 storage=凛私服09e(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=532 top=127 time=200 accel=2 storage=ライダーfd特殊01a(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=303 top=-17 time=200 accel=2 storage=セラfd特殊02c(中)][se storage=se608.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0]Who is that?::
39072::$$$message_0271_0086_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39073::$$$message_0271_0086_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
39074::$$$message_0271_0086_0002$$$::The fourth woman stares at me and Tohsaka.[lr]::
39075::$$$message_0271_0086_0003$$$::The silver-haired woman frowns even more, receiving stares without reserve.[lr]::
39076::$$$message_0271_0086_0004$$$::...Wait, hold on.[lr]::
39077::$$$message_0271_0086_0005$$$::Silver hair, red eyes, that manner of speaking...::
39078::$$$message_0271_0087_0000$$$::"S-[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Sella!?"[lr]::
39079::$$$message_0271_0087_0001$$$::"...Humph. We will not expose any more skin than necessary. It is only natural that you cannot recognize us, since we took off our formal attire."[lr]::
39080::$$$message_0271_0087_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39081::$$$message_0271_0087_0003$$$::...I never would've imagined this after seeing them in their usual maid outfits.[lr]::
39082::$$$message_0271_0087_0004$$$::Despite being a swimsuit, the bright green color makes me feel refreshed.[lr]::
39083::$$$message_0271_0087_0005$$$::It must be because Sella herself is full of freshness.[lr]::
39084::$$$message_0271_0087_0006$$$::It's an inappropriate expression, but "the epitome of feminine beauty" comes to mind.::
39085::$$$message_0271_0088_0000$$$::"W-why are you looking at me like that?[lr]::
39086::$$$message_0271_0088_0001$$$::If you have complaints, please go ahead. I am merely accompanying my lady.[lr]::
39087::$$$message_0271_0088_0002$$$::I am aware that this is not something to be showing to strangers, let alone acquaintances."::
39088::$$$message_0271_0089_0000$$$::Sella hides her body.[lr]::
39089::$$$message_0271_0089_0001$$$::She seems to not have confidence in her own body, but...::
39090::$$$message_0271_0090_0000$$$::"You don't mind others, but you mind us?[lr]::
39091::$$$message_0271_0090_0001$$$::...No, that's not it. I see. You're a serious person, so it's not that we're acquaintances, it's that Emiya's male gaze is[line len=2]"::
39092::$$$message_0271_0091_0000$$$::"A-ahhh, what a misunderstanding![lr]::
39093::$$$message_0271_0091_0001$$$::I-I am simply ashamed of showing my imperfect body, as affiliated with the Einzberns![lr]::
39094::$$$message_0271_0091_0002$$$::Y-you must also be ashamed because your proportions are no match for Rider's!"::
39095::$$$message_0271_0092_0000$$$::"Not really.[lr]::
39096::$$$message_0271_0092_0001$$$::I can't win when it comes to volume, but my overall balance is better.[lr]::
39097::$$$message_0271_0092_0002$$$::It's fine, everyone has their own unique swimsuits."::
39098::$$$message_0271_0093_0000$$$::"The fact that Emiya's making so many faces is proof of that, right?[lr]::
39099::$$$message_0271_0093_0001$$$::Saber, Rider, Ms. Sella, and I all have our own charms, so there is no need for us to be ashamed of losing to someone in some way[line len=2][monocro target=fg][clfg][fg index=2000 pos=l storage=凛fd特殊01d(中)][fg lv2off=1 index=1000 pos=r storage=セラfd特殊02e(中)][fadebgm time=200 volume=0][fadein textoff=0 time=200 storage=o新都_室内プール-(昼) noclear=1]wha[line len=2]"::
39100::$$$message_0271_0094_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
39101::$$$message_0271_0094_0001$$$::Tohsaka's face freezes.[lr]::
39102::$$$message_0271_0094_0002$$$::"H-hi, sorry for the wait!"[lr]::
39103::$$$message_0271_0094_0003$$$::At the end of her gaze is the owner of the fifth voice that comes running towards us in a rush.::
39104::$$$message_0271_0095_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39105::$$$message_0271_0095_0001$$$::Tohsaka is trying to say the rest of her spiel with all her might.[lr]::
39106::$$$message_0271_0095_0002$$$::The appeal of swimsuits varies from person to person.[lr]::
39107::$$$message_0271_0095_0003$$$::That there is no need to be ashamed even if someone's body is better in some regards...[lr]::
39108::$$$message_0271_0095_0004$$$::Even though she was trying to say something good right now...::
39109::$$$message_0271_0096_0000$$$::...Yeah, I get how she feels.[lr]::
39110::$$$message_0271_0096_0001$$$::What is that?[lr]::
39111::$$$message_0271_0096_0002$$$::Rider is fine.[lr]::
39112::$$$message_0271_0096_0003$$$::She's older than us and a foreigner. She's originally a goddess of fertility. I can understand if she's a bit out of proportion compared to others.[lr]::
39113::$$$message_0271_0096_0004$$$::However. This one is younger than me and Tohsaka. And if my blood-related little sister had weapons like that, I'd have all sorts of conflicting emotions. Tohsaka's so stuck, she's shivering...!::
39114::$$$message_0271_0097_0000$$$::"Sakura..."[lr]::
39115::$$$message_0271_0097_0001$$$::Tohsaka's voice is hoarse.[lr]::
39116::$$$message_0271_0097_0002$$$::Her gaze is stuck on Sakura's chest.[lr]::
39117::$$$message_0271_0097_0003$$$::"Uh, yes!? Is something the matter!?"[lr]::
39118::$$$message_0271_0097_0004$$$::"Well... Did you get bigger?"[lr]::
39119::$$$message_0271_0097_0005$$$::"Huh!?"::
39120::$$$message_0271_0098_0000$$$::Sakura freezes in shock.[lr]::
39121::$$$message_0271_0098_0001$$$::Tohsaka's remark is more like a cry of agony than a snide remark.[lr]::
39122::$$$message_0271_0098_0002$$$::She just asked the natural question as her big sister with her last bit of reason.[lr]::
39123::$$$message_0271_0098_0003$$$::Yet.::
39124::$$$message_0271_0099_0000$$$::"No, Sakura. Rin is just trembling with fear at the fact that your chest area has grown again."[lr]::
39125::$$$message_0271_0099_0001$$$::Rider's statement has made it clear who of the two is the overdog and who is the underdog.::
39126::$$$message_0271_0100_0000$$$::"Oh... Come on. Is that true?[lr]::
39127::$$$message_0271_0100_0001$$$::It's okay, there's nothing to worry about at all.[lr]::
39128::$$$message_0271_0100_0002$$$::The appeal of swimsuits varies from person to person. It can't be helped even if just one part is superior, and you also said so yourself. That the overall balance is important."[lr]::
39129::$$$message_0271_0100_0003$$$::You could almost hear her wicked laughter from her smile.::
39130::$$$message_0271_0101_0000$$$::"Oooh... Oooh, mark my words, Sakura!"[cacheimage storage=ライダーfd特殊01c(中),桜fd特殊01h(中),凛fd特殊02h(近)][wvs][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=300 pos=l accel=-2 storage=ライダーfd特殊01c(中)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=600 pos=r accel=-2 storage=桜fd特殊01h(中)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=880 top=7 time=600 accel=3 storage=凛fd特殊02h(近)]::
39131::$$$message_0271_0102_0000$$$::"Well done. Not only did you score your first win, you absolutely knocked her thigh highs off.[lr]::
39132::$$$message_0271_0102_0001$$$::That is my Sakura."[lr]::
39133::$$$message_0271_0102_0002$$$::"Yes, I got her, Rider![lr]::
39134::$$$message_0271_0102_0003$$$::Heheheh, my bust size is invincible!"::
39135::$$$message_0271_0103_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39136::$$$message_0271_0103_0001$$$::The devil leaves.[lr]::
39137::$$$message_0271_0103_0002$$$::However, an even stronger devil has just been born here.[lr]::
39138::$$$message_0271_0103_0003$$$::"...Uh. Hey, Sakura. It's not like Tohsaka had any real malice just now, you know."[lr]::
39139::$$$message_0271_0103_0004$$$::Well, she didn't even have a millimeter of malice.::
39140::$$$message_0271_0104_0000$$$::"You're too soft, Senpai! The poolside is a woman's battlefield! Those who have no power cry while running away! Here, chest measurement equals control!"[lr]::
39141::$$$message_0271_0104_0001$$$::Sakura shows more excitement than ever.[lr]::
39142::$$$message_0271_0104_0002$$$::Rider claps and praises the dictator.::
39143::$$$message_0271_0105_0000$$$::"Sakura, down that road lies danger.[lr]::
39144::$$$message_0271_0105_0001$$$::If strength is justice, then might makes right.[lr]::
39145::$$$message_0271_0105_0002$$$::We can still make it. I believe we should extend a hand to Rin, who is drinking a liter of juice in despair."::
39146::$$$message_0271_0106_0000$$$::"Do not worry, Saber; [wvl][se volume=70 storage=se023.wav]there are no enemies that intimidate me.[lr]::
39147::$$$message_0271_0106_0001$$$::Today is probably the best day for Sakura Matou at Waku Waku Zabuun! I can't lose to [cacheimage storage=white,桜fd特殊02a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=700][textoff][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav][fadein time=100 storage=white][stopdash][stopmove][dash page=back mx=47 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.025 cx=36 imag=5.8 time=600 cy=123 mag=1.8 my=-26 storage=o新都_釣り場(嵐)b rot=-0.022 accel=3][fg left=280 index=1000 top=221 storage=桜fd特殊02a(近)][se storage=se608.wav][movefg page=back opacity=255 time=500 pos=c accel=4 storage=桜fd特殊02a(近)][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav][transex time=200][wvl canskip=0 time=600]Saber or my sister[wvl][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav] or anyone[wvl][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav]...[se storage=se608.wav]!!!"::
39148::$$$message_0271_0107_0000$$$::Lightning strikes.[lr]::
39149::$$$message_0271_0107_0001$$$::...Sakura is overflowing with unprecedented confidence.[lr]::
39150::$$$message_0271_0107_0002$$$::...That's understandable. If I were shown such a thing, I would also put in a vote for Sakura... [wait canskip=0 time=600]Wait, hold on.[lr]::
39151::$$$message_0271_0107_0003$$$::...What is that?::
39152::$$$message_0271_0108_0000$$$::"...Saber, you knew?"[lr]::
39153::$$$message_0271_0108_0001$$$::"...Yes. She helped me when we were changing."[lr]::
39154::$$$message_0271_0108_0002$$$::We sigh mournfully.::
39155::$$$message_0271_0109_0000$$$::"S-Senpai? Saber? What's wrong? Why do you both look like you've seen something unbelievable?"[lr]::
39156::$$$message_0271_0109_0001$$$::"Well... That's exactly it, Sakura."[lr]::
39157::$$$message_0271_0109_0002$$$::"...How unfortunate. It was a short reign, Sakura."[lr]::
39158::$$$message_0271_0109_0003$$$::"C-come on, even you, Rider? ...Wahh, I really don't want to look behind me..."::
39159::$$$message_0271_0110_0000$$$::Sakura timidly turns around.[lr]::
39160::$$$message_0271_0110_0001$$$::There...[lr]::
39161::$$$message_0271_0110_0002$$$::"NO WAYYYYY!?!?!?"[lr]::
39162::$$$message_0271_0110_0003$$$::...is the sixth challenger that surpasses Sakura.::
39163::$$$message_0271_0111_0000$$$::"Hm? Sella, something happen?"[lr]::
39164::$$$message_0271_0111_0001$$$::There is no need to say who it is.[lr]::
39165::$$$message_0271_0111_0002$$$::It is the other maid, Leys, also known as Leysritt.::
39166::$$$message_0271_0112_0000$$$::"There is nothing to worry about, Leysritt. That was just the howl of an underdog."[lr]::
39167::$$$message_0271_0112_0001$$$::"Underdog? Sakura?"[lr]::
39168::$$$message_0271_0112_0002$$$::"...Yeah. You in your swimsuit had so much destructive power that Sakura lies in ruin."[lr]::
39169::$$$message_0271_0112_0003$$$::"Huh???"::
39170::$$$message_0271_0113_0000$$$::"...T-there's always a bigger fish... T-this is the first lesson to hit home like this..." [lr]::
39171::$$$message_0271_0113_0001$$$::"...Heheheh, you understand now, Sakura.[lr]::
39172::$$$message_0271_0113_0002$$$::Yes, what's important is balance. Humans can't get caught up by just one thing."[lr]::
39173::$$$message_0271_0113_0003$$$::"Yes, it made me realize...that I still have so much to learn about the real world..."[lr]::
39174::$$$message_0271_0113_0004$$$::And the underdogs confirm their sisterly love.::
39175::$$$message_0271_0114_0000$$$::"Man... You both look good in swimsuits.[lr]::
39176::$$$message_0271_0114_0001$$$::I had the impression that you guys don't go outside much, so I thought you guys didn't like the pool. What a waste; I should've invited you both together with Illya earlier."[lr]::
39177::$$$message_0271_0114_0002$$$::I'm sure Illya would feel at ease if she was with the two of them.::
39178::$$$message_0271_0115_0000$$$::"T-that's fine. I go to the pool for a moment of relaxation sometimes!"[lr]::
39179::$$$message_0271_0115_0001$$$::"Wait, really?"[lr]::
39180::$$$message_0271_0115_0002$$$::"...Yes. You'll see Sella around pretty often."[lr]::
39181::$$$message_0271_0115_0003$$$::"Yeah. No river in forest. Sella likes swimming."::
39182::$$$message_0271_0116_0000$$$::"N-never mind my interests![lr]::
39183::$$$message_0271_0116_0001$$$::More than that, what about Mistress? Has Mistress finished changing, Leysritt!?"[lr]::
39184::$$$message_0271_0116_0002$$$::"Yes. Your turn, Illya."[lr]::
39185::$$$message_0271_0116_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
39186::$$$message_0271_0116_0004$$$::I look over to her, wondering when she had come.::
39187::$$$message_0271_0117_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39188::$$$message_0271_0117_0001$$$::...Huh...? Something's wrong with me.[lr]::
39189::$$$message_0271_0117_0002$$$::Words escape me. I can't even focus my eyesight.::
39190::$$$message_0271_0118_0000$$$::"How lovely. It looks very good on you, Illyasviel."[lr]::
39191::$$$message_0271_0118_0001$$$::"Seriously. I didn't think that your look would change this much. I'm reevaluating the color pink right now."[lr]::
39192::$$$message_0271_0118_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39193::$$$message_0271_0118_0003$$$::"Ahaha... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(中)]My heart is beating fast, Senpai."::
39194::$$$message_0271_0119_0000$$$::"O-oh, I see."[lr]::
39195::$$$message_0271_0119_0001$$$::I inwardly agree with Sakura's words.[lr]::
39196::$$$message_0271_0119_0002$$$::"...Master Emiya. We have not received any words from you yet."[lr]::
39197::$$$message_0271_0119_0003$$$::Sella's courteous words sound like a foreign language.[lr]::
39198::$$$message_0271_0119_0004$$$::My dazed mind can't say a single word in response.::
39199::$$$message_0271_0120_0000$$$::"Master Emiya."[lr]::
39200::$$$message_0271_0120_0001$$$::"You don't need to ask that, Sella. You can tell just by looking at Shirou's face."[lr]::
39201::$$$message_0271_0120_0002$$$::"But my lady, an opportunity like this may or may not even present itself once in Shirou's lifetime; no, even if he was to reincarnate over and over again. You must give him the opportunity to respond to your glory."::
39202::$$$message_0271_0121_0000$$$::"Ugh, you're so dramatic, Sella. You're also bothering Shirou. Any time is fine for that."::
39203::$$$message_0271_0122_0000$$$::Illya runs in excitement to the water's edge.[lr]::
39204::$$$message_0271_0122_0001$$$::She turns back, letting her silver hair flutter.[lr]::
39205::$$$message_0271_0122_0002$$$::"Thank you for waiting for a long time.[lr]::
39206::$$$message_0271_0122_0003$$$::We will open Zabuun and we'll have a ton of fun today!"::
39207::$$$message_0271_0123_0000$$$::A gun salute is fired to match the opening announcement.[lr]::
39208::$$$message_0271_0123_0001$$$::The everlasting summer merrymaking that started on a whim has begun.::
39209::$$$message_0271_0124_0000$$$::Time passes like sand.[lr]::
39210::$$$message_0271_0124_0001$$$::There was a 100-meter relay that was carried out in two teams, a hellish game of beach volleyball, [l][smudge range=fore level=1][clfg][dash page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=1.2 time=100 cy=300 mag=1.2 my=0 storage=o演劇06_海上01b-(曇2) rot=-0.0 accel=0][fg bluroff=1 left=-95 index=6000 top=159 storage=108_saberback][fg left=254 index=2000 top=61 storage=141_黄昏rinn][fg left=359 index=3000 top=-7 storage=141_黄昏sakura][fg bluroff=1 fliplr=1 left=387 index=4000 top=285 storage=ガーンa][move page=back opacity=255 storage=141_黄昏rinn cx=81 py=164 px=337 affine=(337,164,140,0.4,255,81,102) time=100 cy=102 mag=0.4 deg=140 accel=0][move page=back opacity=255 storage=141_黄昏sakura cx=68 py=92 px=447 affine=(447,92,20,0.4,255,68,99) time=100 cy=99 mag=0.4 deg=20 accel=0][move page=back opacity=255 storage=ガーンa cx=28 py=340 px=350 affine=(351,341,27,2.2,255,28,55) time=100 cy=55 mag=2.2 deg=27 accel=0][se volume=100 storage=se023.wav][transex time=600]a rubber boat survival game with the wave pool set to the max, and so on.[lr]::
39211::$$$message_0271_0124_0002$$$::We do all the games for large groups of people for the most part, and once we finish eating lunch, it's one in the afternoon.[lr]::
39212::$$$message_0271_0124_0003$$$::I take a bit of a break on a nearby bench.::
39213::$$$message_0271_0125_0000$$$::Illya and the others must be taking a small break too, as they are splashing around in the shallows of the wave pool.[lr]::
39214::$$$message_0271_0125_0001$$$::Saber, Sakura, and the others seem to be having fun too, but Illya in particular seems to be enjoying herself.::
39215::$$$message_0271_0126_0000$$$::"...But..."[lr]::
39216::$$$message_0271_0126_0001$$$::What a magnificent sight.[lr]::
39217::$$$message_0271_0126_0002$$$::Did I get lost in some kind of outstanding paradise?::
39218::$$$message_0271_0127_0000$$$::"It really is quite something when I think about it."[lr]::
39219::$$$message_0271_0127_0001$$$::"Yeah, it is. This turn of events isn't something you see every day."[lr]::
39220::$$$message_0271_0127_0002$$$::"Right? Even as someone who is called a quiet and unsociable person, I feel like something might happen to me."[lr]::
39221::$$$message_0271_0127_0003$$$::"Hmm, I feel like any male whose reproductive instincts aren't stirred in this situation has a problem."[lr]::
39222::$$$message_0271_0127_0004$$$::"Well, even I can agree with that."::
39223::$$$message_0271_0128_0000$$$::We laugh together.[lr]::
39224::$$$message_0271_0128_0001$$$::"...Wait, when did you get here!?"[lr]::
39225::$$$message_0271_0128_0002$$$::"Oh? I thought you'd noticed earlier. Am I really so small as to be ignored?[lr]::
39226::$$$message_0271_0128_0003$$$::Sorry about that. I'm a little late with my greeting."::
39227::$$$message_0271_0129_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39228::$$$message_0271_0129_0001$$$::...I can't deal with him.[lr]::
39229::$$$message_0271_0129_0002$$$::Because of his other form, I can't. In fact, the nicer he is, the more uneasy I feel. Even when he's really sweet like now.::
39230::$$$message_0271_0130_0000$$$::"...So. Why are you here?[lr]::
39231::$$$message_0271_0130_0001$$$::We have this place reserved for today."[lr]::
39232::$$$message_0271_0130_0002$$$::"I know. I'm the one who approved the reservation."[lr]::
39233::$$$message_0271_0130_0003$$$::"Guh. Approved as in..."[lr]::
39234::$$$message_0271_0130_0004$$$::"I'm the owner of this facility."[lr]::
39235::$$$message_0271_0130_0005$$$::He answers right away.[lr]::
39236::$$$message_0271_0130_0006$$$::All right. I'm not going to think that deeply about it.::
39237::$$$message_0271_0131_0000$$$::"...No wonder the name is so strange... Well, anyway. Even if you're the owner, that doesn't mean you can mingle with us."::
39238::$$$message_0271_0132_0000$$$::"That's that, and this is something else. Or would you rather have an encounter with the red and blue guys?[lr]::
39239::$$$message_0271_0132_0001$$$::They tried to break in. I chased them off."[lr]::
39240::$$$message_0271_0132_0002$$$::"...Then, thanks. It seems I'm always in the wrong with you."::
39241::$$$message_0271_0133_0000$$$::I shake hands with him.[lr]::
39242::$$$message_0271_0133_0001$$$::He grins back at me.[lr]::
39243::$$$message_0271_0133_0002$$$::At that moment, a true friendship between us had formed just for this one day.[lr]::
39244::$$$message_0271_0133_0003$$$::And serves you right, you muscle-headed Servant duo...!::
39245::$$$message_0271_0134_0000$$$::"And well, I appreciate that you chased the intruders away, but...what is your motive?"[lr]::
39246::$$$message_0271_0134_0001$$$::"I don't have any reason in particular. Maybe I'm just a little nosy when it comes to love. My personal favorite isn't here anyway."[lr]::
39247::$$$message_0271_0134_0002$$$::"Favorite...?"[lr]::
39248::$$$message_0271_0134_0003$$$::It wasn't...Saber?[lr]::
39249::$$$message_0271_0134_0004$$$::For some reason, his tastes are different when he's in this form.::
39250::$$$message_0271_0135_0000$$$::"Saber is not bad. I'm not interested in snakes or fake flowers.[lr]::
39251::$$$message_0271_0135_0001$$$::The women mages are... Well, if I have the time."[lr]::
39252::$$$message_0271_0135_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39253::$$$message_0271_0135_0003$$$::That was a subtly problematic statement.[lr]::
39254::$$$message_0271_0135_0004$$$::A man who is only interested in one person, and a boy who is interested in anyone if their interests match.[lr]::
39255::$$$message_0271_0135_0005$$$::There's no doubt that both are dangerous.::
39256::$$$message_0271_0136_0000$$$::"And what is your angle, then? If you have a favorite, you shouldn't be dilly-dallying here, right?"[lr]::
39257::$$$message_0271_0136_0001$$$::"Mrgh..."[lr]::
39258::$$$message_0271_0136_0002$$$::He doesn't need to tell me that.[lr]::
39259::$$$message_0271_0136_0003$$$::I remember now after all this time how today even happened in the first place.::
39260::$$$message_0271_0137_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. I was putting it off.[lr]::
39261::$$$message_0271_0137_0001$$$::...Could it be that you[line len=2]"[lr]::
39262::$$$message_0271_0137_0002$$$::Did he secretly come because he couldn't bear to watch what was going on?::
39263::$$$message_0271_0138_0000$$$::"No way. I'm overthinking."[lr]::
39264::$$$message_0271_0138_0001$$$::"Oh, are you going already?"[lr]::
39265::$$$message_0271_0138_0002$$$::"Yeah. I need to teach Illya how to swim."[lr]::
39266::$$$message_0271_0138_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
39267::$$$message_0271_0138_0004$$$::He makes an innocent face.[lr]::
39268::$$$message_0271_0138_0005$$$::It's as if he is murmuring that it was an unnecessary intervention.::
39269::$$$message_0271_0139_0000$$$::"Okay. Well then, see you later.[lr]::
39270::$$$message_0271_0139_0001$$$::I will take my leave now. Please have fun with your little sister."[lr]::
39271::$$$message_0271_0139_0002$$$::He pushes through the high grass, and Zabuun's owner leaves in a rather manly manner.::
39272::$$$message_0271_0140_0000$$$::"...All right...!"[lr]::
39273::$$$message_0271_0140_0001$$$::I get up from the bench, and slap my cheeks.[lr]::
39274::$$$message_0271_0140_0002$$$::"Hey, Illya!"[lr]::
39275::$$$message_0271_0140_0003$$$::I wave my arm and call out Illya's name.[lr]::
39276::$$$message_0271_0140_0004$$$::It's a little late, but I'll go fulfill my promise.::
39277::$$$message_0271_0141_0000$$$::So...[lr]::
39278::$$$message_0271_0141_0001$$$::I started the Illya swimming school, full of spirit, to teach Illya how to swim starting from the basics.::
39279::$$$message_0271_0142_0000$$$::"See, I'm totally fine, right?[lr]::
39280::$$$message_0271_0142_0001$$$::I can swim just fine!"[lr]::
39281::$$$message_0271_0142_0002$$$::"What the...!"[lr]::
39282::$$$message_0271_0142_0003$$$::My objective has been cleared.[lr]::
39283::$$$message_0271_0142_0004$$$::Illya, who did not participate in the 100-meter relay in the morning, is demonstrating an impressive front crawl...!::
39284::$$$message_0271_0143_0000$$$::"...Wow. You're better at swimming than me, Illya."[lr]::
39285::$$$message_0271_0143_0001$$$::"I rarely swim, but I'm good at swimming.[lr]::
39286::$$$message_0271_0143_0002$$$::I can swim in crashing waves if I try. I don't since I get tired, though."::
39287::$$$message_0271_0144_0000$$$::She got mad at me.[lr]::
39288::$$$message_0271_0144_0001$$$::She was still in a good mood when I pulled her aside, and when she came into the middle of the wave pool.::
39289::$$$message_0271_0145_0000$$$::"Sorry. But if you can swim, then there'll be more things you can do in the afternoon. Then, we can work together next and beat Rider and Saber."[lr]::
39290::$$$message_0271_0145_0001$$$::"Y-yes. Yeah, that's not a bad idea either...[lr]::
39291::$$$message_0271_0145_0002$$$::We should rest a bit more before that."[lr]::
39292::$$$message_0271_0145_0003$$$::Even while saying that, there's no indication of her returning to the poolside.[lr]::
39293::$$$message_0271_0145_0004$$$::Apparently taking a break to Illya means that she wants to be floating here.::
39294::$$$message_0271_0146_0000$$$::"Then, why don't we stay here a bit longer?[lr]::
39295::$$$message_0271_0146_0001$$$::...But, you really are good, Illya. Did Sella teach you how to swim?"[lr]::
39296::$$$message_0271_0146_0002$$$::"Huh? I'm the one who taught Sella.[lr]::
39297::$$$message_0271_0146_0003$$$::...Sella is slow at learning, yet she really loves water. I wonder how many times I've saved her when she was about to drown."[lr]::
39298::$$$message_0271_0146_0004$$$::"Oh. So Sella is unathletic."::
39299::$$$message_0271_0147_0000$$$::"Rather than unathletic, she's absolutely no good![lr]::
39300::$$$message_0271_0147_0001$$$::But water is our source, so she begged me saying that she wants to get used to it.[lr]::
39301::$$$message_0271_0147_0002$$$::Thanks to that, I got better too. Even though I only knew about swimming in theory."[lr]::
39302::$$$message_0271_0147_0003$$$::She smiles delightedly.[lr]::
39303::$$$message_0271_0147_0004$$$::...I'm glad. It seems like she's feeling a bit better.::
39304::$$$message_0271_0148_0000$$$::"...Wait, so you learned swimming on your own?"[lr]::
39305::$$$message_0271_0148_0001$$$::"Yeah. I'm Lorelei. The water would teach me how to swim."[lr]::
39306::$$$message_0271_0148_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39307::$$$message_0271_0148_0003$$$::It's the same as before.[lr]::
39308::$$$message_0271_0148_0004$$$::Illya's smile makes my mind go blank.[lr]::
39309::$$$message_0271_0148_0005$$$::The floating sensation that makes me feel dizzy is close to vertigo, but it's definitely not.::
39310::$$$message_0271_0149_0000$$$::"...First off..."[lr]::
39311::$$$message_0271_0149_0001$$$::I-I'm not supposed to think this, but this is, you know[line len=2][lr]::
39312::$$$message_0271_0149_0002$$$::"Stop right there...![lr]::
39313::$$$message_0271_0149_0003$$$::I-Illya, let's swim! Let's swim a lap around the wave pool and go back to where Saber and the others are!"[lr]::
39314::$$$message_0271_0149_0004$$$::She shakes her head.::
39315::$$$message_0271_0150_0000$$$::"No, I refuse. I said I'm going to rest a bit longer.[lr]::
39316::$$$message_0271_0150_0001$$$::If you're bored, then well... I'll ask you questions."[lr]::
39317::$$$message_0271_0150_0002$$$::"Questions?"[lr]::
39318::$$$message_0271_0150_0003$$$::"Yeah. You saw everyone in their swimsuits.[lr]::
39319::$$$message_0271_0150_0004$$$::Who was the prettiest?"::
39320::$$$message_0271_0151_0000$$$::"The prettiest...?"[lr]::
39321::$$$message_0271_0151_0001$$$::"Yeah. The prettiest."[lr]::
39322::$$$message_0271_0151_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39323::$$$message_0271_0151_0003$$$::T-that's a hard question.[lr]::
39324::$$$message_0271_0151_0004$$$::I bet saying "everyone was pretty" wouldn't cut it.::
39325::$$$message_0271_0152_0000$$$::"There really is no saving you.[lr]::
39326::$$$message_0271_0152_0001$$$::Then, what about Saber? What did you think, Shirou?"[lr]::
39327::$$$message_0271_0152_0002$$$::"Saber is... Well, healthy, or pretty like a pure flower."::
39328::$$$message_0271_0153_0000$$$::"Then, what about Rider?"[lr]::
39329::$$$message_0271_0153_0001$$$::"Rider is... She was pretty, but more mature than that. Like an Olympic athlete; pretty like that."::
39330::$$$message_0271_0154_0000$$$::"...Then next. Rin?"[lr]::
39331::$$$message_0271_0154_0001$$$::"Tohsaka was vibrant. If we're talking about looks, I think she was the most conventionally attractive."::
39332::$$$message_0271_0155_0000$$$::"...Then, Sella?"[lr]::
39333::$$$message_0271_0155_0001$$$::"Sella is... Well, Sella and Leys were totally unexpected. They were both surprisingly pretty."::
39334::$$$message_0271_0156_0000$$$::"...Sakura?"[lr]::
39335::$$$message_0271_0156_0001$$$::"Sakura was pretty too, but more than that, I wasn't sure where to look. Her healthy allure was quite something, right...?"[lr]::
39336::$$$message_0271_0156_0002$$$::"..."::
39337::$$$message_0271_0157_0000$$$::Illya's questions stop.[lr]::
39338::$$$message_0271_0157_0001$$$::She sinks a bit into the water.[lr]::
39339::$$$message_0271_0157_0002$$$::"...Then, what about me?"[lr]::
39340::$$$message_0271_0157_0003$$$::Illya asks.::
39341::$$$message_0271_0158_0000$$$::I nod dizzily.[lr]::
39342::$$$message_0271_0158_0001$$$::...Oh yeah.[lr]::
39343::$$$message_0271_0158_0002$$$::Everyone was equally as pretty. But if I had to choose the best one...::
39344::$$$message_0271_0159_0000$$$::"...You made me the most nervous."[lr]::
39345::$$$message_0271_0159_0001$$$::Ugh, exactly. There's no use in trying to cover it up at this point.[lr]::
39346::$$$message_0271_0159_0002$$$::As spineless as I am, I was undeniably charmed by Illya in her swimsuit and couldn't think straight.::
39347::$$$message_0271_0160_0000$$$::"My heart is still beating fast actually.[lr]::
39348::$$$message_0271_0160_0001$$$::...Um, you know. Are you nervous?"[lr]::
39349::$$$message_0271_0160_0002$$$::I scratch my cheek and ask her, without looking away somehow.[lr]::
39350::$$$message_0271_0160_0003$$$::"Yeah! My heart is beating fast, too!"[lr]::
39351::$$$message_0271_0160_0004$$$::I can't stop Illya from wrapping her arms around my neck and I fall into the water with her.::
39352::$$$message_0271_0161_0000$$$::"Stupid Shirou![lr]::
39353::$$$message_0271_0161_0001$$$::I was really about to hate you for making me wait for three hours!"[lr]::
39354::$$$message_0271_0161_0002$$$::Illya spins around while still holding onto my neck.::
39355::$$$message_0271_0162_0000$$$::"But I made it, didn't I? We still have the whole afternoon.[lr]::
39356::$$$message_0271_0162_0001$$$::Where should we go next, Illya?"[lr]::
39357::$$$message_0271_0162_0002$$$::"The slide! Oh, of course with Saber and the others. I'm going to show off to you the whole afternoon to get back at you for making me anxious the whole morning!"::
39358::$$$message_0271_0163_0000$$$::Her lively voice is synchronized with the splashing water.[lr]::
39359::$$$message_0271_0163_0001$$$::Illya moves her energetic and petite body just like she's celebrating a long-awaited birthday.[lr]::
39360::$$$message_0271_0163_0002$$$::"...All right. I'm scared about later, but let's show them the power of friendship!"[lr]::
39361::$$$message_0271_0163_0003$$$::I carry Illya on my shoulders and hurry over to the pool where everyone awaits.[lr]::
39362::$$$message_0271_0163_0004$$$::The excited voices echo even higher.[lr]::
39363::$$$message_0271_0163_0005$$$::Just like the phrase, "everlasting summer", the best day ever continues for a little while longer.::
39364::$$$message_0271_0164_0000$$$::The evening arrives quickly.[lr]::
39365::$$$message_0271_0164_0001$$$::Even for the nonsense day of reserving Zabuun, it seems like nothing can be done about the setting sun.::
39366::$$$message_0271_0165_0000$$$::"Ah, I'm so tired.[lr]::
39367::$$$message_0271_0165_0001$$$::Who's the one who said we should go around all the pools if we're here anyway? I'm for sure going to be sore all over tomorrow."[lr]::
39368::$$$message_0271_0165_0002$$$::"But it was fun. I wouldn't have been able to jump from a fifty-meter-high diving board, since I'm usually embarrassed."::
39369::$$$message_0271_0166_0000$$$::"Making lunch using the iron griddle from the food stand was also quite something.[lr]::
39370::$$$message_0271_0166_0001$$$::I'm sure making yakisoba with everyone is something that we will not be able to do very often."[lr]::
39371::$$$message_0271_0166_0002$$$::"Though your cooking was horrible.[lr]::
39372::$$$message_0271_0166_0003$$$::On the other hand, your luck is exceptionally strong. Why do you force disasters that you have caused onto others[line len=2]especially me?"::
39373::$$$message_0271_0167_0000$$$::We rambunctiously leave behind the time of enjoyment just like we started.[lr]::
39374::$$$message_0271_0167_0001$$$::Illya and I match each other's pace, put some distance between us and everyone else, and look on at their smiles.[lr]::
39375::$$$message_0271_0167_0002$$$::Instead of just blankly watching, I stared so that I wouldn't forget, since it was something rather irreplaceable.::
39376::$$$message_0271_0168_0000$$$::"Yes, this is the end of something special.[lr]::
39377::$$$message_0271_0168_0001$$$::Make sure to rest your body, Shirou. The usual evening awaits once you get home."[lr]::
39378::$$$message_0271_0168_0002$$$::"Thanks for the warning. It's okay, I won't be going out at night. My whole body is sore from swimming too much."::
39379::$$$message_0271_0169_0000$$$::Walking home like this is the best that I can do.[lr]::
39380::$$$message_0271_0169_0001$$$::I smell the nostalgic scent of chlorine from my body that was in the pool the whole day.[lr]::
39381::$$$message_0271_0169_0002$$$::I should go home to sleep and replay the events that went by in a flash in my mind.::
39382::$$$message_0271_0170_0000$$$::"Then, we'll part at Miyama.[lr]::
39383::$$$message_0271_0170_0001$$$::I pushed Sella and Leys a little too hard too. I need to go back to the castle tonight."[lr]::
39384::$$$message_0271_0170_0002$$$::"I see. Then I'll see you tomorrow, Illya."[lr]::
39385::$$$message_0271_0170_0003$$$::She nods.[lr]::
39386::$$$message_0271_0170_0004$$$::We walk towards the evening town like siblings.::
39387::$$$message_0271_0171_0000$$$::Suddenly...[lr]::
39388::$$$message_0271_0171_0001$$$::She takes an exaggerated bow, just like the first time we talked.::
39389::$$$message_0271_0172_0000$$$::"I had fun, Shirou.[lr]::
39390::$$$message_0271_0172_0001$$$::Thank you for remembering such a small promise that could've easily been overlooked."[lr]::
39391::$$$message_0271_0172_0002$$$::"Same here. I feel bad that I was late."[lr]::
39392::$$$message_0271_0172_0003$$$::"No worries. Let's come again sometime, Big Brother."::
39393::$$$message_0271_0173_0000$$$::The sky is awfully far.[lr]::
39394::$$$message_0271_0173_0001$$$::The sunlight sets in the horizon.[lr]::
39395::$$$message_0271_0173_0002$$$::Today was a brilliant day, and I have nothing to complain about.[lr]::
39396::$$$message_0271_0173_0003$$$::I was able to make memories that don't fall short to that sinking light.::��